// m_scene.momo - GENERATED by the vector study. Do not edit.
//
//   cd ../20260826-vector-study && npm run emit
//
// The scene ladder, flattened into one set of arrays. A scene is a run of
// paths, a path is a run of ops and a run of points, and nothing nests - which
// is what lets three levels of structure be six flat arrays and no pointers.
//
// Chunk 1 is lines only. `curved-blob` needs quadratics and arrives with
// chunk 2, so it is not here yet.
//
// Scene order, which the expected output depends on:
//   0  triangle  - covers line edges, one span per scanline
//   1  hole-opposite  - covers a hole at all
//   2  hole-same  - covers nonzero against even-odd
//   3  bowtie  - covers a self-crossing subpath, four crossings with a cancelling middle pair
//   4  pentagram  - covers winding depth 2 by self-crossing
//   5  shared-vertex  - covers same-x crossing merge

